sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant I as Intake
    participant P as Planner
    participant A as Actor
    participant TG as Tool Gateway
    participant EO as Evidence Observation
    participant PEP as Governance PEP
    participant PDP as OPA PDP
    participant PS as Pillar Services
    participant J as Semantic Judge
    participant DC as Decision Combiner (Rego)
    participant H as HITL Gateway
    participant R as Replanner
    participant X as External Execution
    participant F as Finalize
    participant T as Trace / artifacts

    U->>I: Raw task
    I-->>P: Canonical IntakeResult and execution policy
    P-->>A: Typed semantic plan
    loop Per current plan step / actor turn
        A->>PEP: Typed ActorResult at an operational boundary
        Note over A,PEP: route_after_actor always routes to governance
        PEP->>PDP: required_pillars(base facts only)
        PDP-->>PEP: requirement booleans
        Note over PDP,PEP: OPA query 1: evidence and trajectory requirement is event-sensitive

        opt external operation proposal exists
            PEP->>PS: Build risk raw facts (shadow only)
            PS-->>PEP: risk signal#59; decision_influence=false
        end
        opt require_evidence=true
            PEP->>PS: Build evidence raw facts
            PS-->>PEP: evidence signal and snapshot/selection digests
        end
        opt require_trajectory=true
            PEP->>PS: Build trajectory raw facts
            PS-->>PEP: trajectory signal
        end
        opt stable audit boundary OR external operation exists
            PEP->>PS: Read behavioral SQLite model (shadow only)
            PS-->>PEP: behavioral signal#59; decision_influence=false
        end
        Note over PEP,PS: Static policy is evaluated in Rego#59; it is not a Python pillar-service call.

        PEP->>PDP: preliminary decision input + not-required Judge signal
        PDP->>DC: Evaluate precedence#59; expose judge_admission
        DC-->>PDP: preliminary output with judge_admission
        PDP-->>PEP: preliminary decision output
        Note over PDP,PEP: OPA query 2: Python consumes judge_admission only#59; it does not apply this preliminary directive.

        opt judge_admission.required=true
            PEP->>J: Digest-bound governed-external candidate + evidence bundle
            J-->>PEP: judge assessment / findings / digest bindings
        end
        PEP->>PDP: final decision input: base facts + all pillar signals
        PDP->>DC: Apply Rego precedence and safety invariants
        DC-->>PDP: final directive, reason codes, pillar results, judge admission
        PDP-->>PEP: validated final governance decision
        Note over PDP,PEP: OPA query 3: OPA/Rego is the only final-directive authority.
        PEP->>T: Append governance history#59; static/dynamic/behavioral/judge records#59; step record

        alt directive CONTINUE / CONTINUE_READ_ONLY and actor proposed read-only tool
            PEP->>TG: Route READY_TOOL_EXECUTION with typed request
            TG-->>EO: ToolExecutionResult (success/failure/cache/guard result)
            EO-->>A: Concrete ToolObservations#59; update scratchpad and progress when new
            Note over EO,A: If another pending tool request exists, observation first re-enters governance#59; otherwise actor resumes.
            EO->>T: Record tool call/result, accepted observations and step record
        else directive REPLAN or actor NEEDS_REPLAN accepted
            PEP->>R: Route REPLANNING
            R-->>A: Replace current/pending semantic trajectory
            R->>T: Record replanning state/steps in canonical state
        else directive WAIT_HUMAN_REVIEW or ASK_USER_CLARIFICATION
            PEP->>H: Typed request: request ID, allowed decisions, reasons, digest-bound proposal
            H-->>U: LangGraph interrupt payload
            U-->>H: Typed resume decision (optionally digest-bound approval/edit)
            alt modify-and-continue
                H-->>PEP: READY_GOVERNANCE#59; re-govern changed digest
            else request more evidence
                H-->>A: Resume ACTING
            else replan
                H-->>R: Resume REPLANNING
            else approved governed external execution
                H-->>X: READY_EXTERNAL_EXECUTION with human authorization
            else abort / terminal decision
                H-->>F: ABORTED or terminal state
            end
            H->>T: Record review request, decision and edit history
        else directive REQUEST_MORE_EVIDENCE / REVISE_ACTION
            PEP-->>A: Restore step for evidence collection or bounded revision
        else directive STOP
            PEP->>F: ABORTED
        else authorized governed external proposal
            PEP->>X: READY_EXTERNAL_EXECUTION with OPA digest authorization
            X->>X: Preflight exact digest, policy envelope, registry and idempotency
            alt receipt executed
                X-->>F: COMPLETED with typed receipt
            else retryable failed under attempt bound
                X->>X: Retry with a new attempt scope
            else indeterminate
                X->>H: Human reconciliation required#59; no automatic retry
            else deterministic failure / rejected preflight
                X-->>F: ABORTED
            end
            X->>T: Record external request, receipt history and step record
        else local step accepted / no more work
            PEP->>A: READY_NEXT_STEP or ACTING
        end
    end
    F->>T: Persist final runtime state and trace artifacts
    T-->>U: full-trace-2.json, trace_summary.md, dashboard snapshot
